{title: 438 - You Will See Your Lord A-Coming}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Early Advent}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[D]You will [G]see your Lord a[D]coming,
You will see your [A7]Lord a[D]coming,
You will [G]see your Lord a[D]coming
In a few [A]more [D]days.
[D]Hear [A]the [D]band of music,
[A]Hear [Bm]the [A]band of [D]music,
[D]Hear the band of music
[A]which [Bm]is [A]sounding [A7]thro’ the [D]air.

Refrain:
[D]Hear [G]the band [D]of music,
[A7]Hear the [D]band of music,
[G]Hear the [D]band of music
[A]which is sounding [D]thro' the air.

Verse 2:
[D]Gabriel [G]sounds his [D]mighty trumpet,
[A7]Gabriel sounds [D]his mighty trumpet,
[G]Gabriel sounds [D]his mighty trumpet
[A]In a [D]few more days.

Verse 3:
[D]You will [G]see the [D]saints arising,
[A7]You will see [D]the saints arising,
[G]You will see [D]the saints arising
[A]In a [D]few more days.

Verse 4:
[D]Angels bear [G]them to [D]the Savior,
[A7]Angels bear them [D]to the Savior,
[G]Angels bear them [D]to the Savior
[A]In a [D]few more days.

Verse 5:
[D]Then we'll [G]shout, our [D]suff'ring over,
[A7]Then we'll shout, [D]our suff'ring over,
[G]Then we'll shout, [D]our suff'ring over
[A]In a [D]few more days.</div>
